  "provider_query": "用中文找 MDN 上 Array.prototype.flatMap 的英文文档原文",
  "answer": "MDN 英文原文主页面与相关条目如下（最多 8 条）。\n\n1. **Array.prototype.flatMap()（英文原文）**  \n   https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Array/flatMap  \n   要点：对每个元素调用回调，再将结果扁平化一层；等价于 `map(...).flat()`，但通常更高效。语法：`flatMap(callbackFn)` / `flatMap(callbackFn, thisArg)`。自 2020 年 1 月起广泛可用。最后修改：2025-07-20。  \n   [[1]](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Array/flatMap)\n\n2. **同页：返回值与说明**  \n   返回新数组，元素为回调结果并按深度 1 扁平化。`flatMap` 是迭代方法，与 `map(callbackFn, thisArg)` 后接 `flat(1)` 相同；回调应返回数组以便展开，或返回非数组值直接加入结果。  \n   [[1]](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Array/flatMap)\n\n3. **同页：示例 map() 与 flatMap()**  \n   `arr.map(x => [x * 2])` 得到嵌套数组；`arr.flatMap(x => [x * 2])` 得到一层扁平结果。只扁平一层：`flatMap(x => [[x * 2]])` 仍保持嵌套。  \n   [[1]](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Array/flatMap)\n\n4. **同页：增删元素**  \n   返回空数组可删除项，返回多元素数组可增加项，返回单元素数组可保留项。  \n   [[1]](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Array/flatMap)\n\n5. **规范链接（英文页 Specifications）**  \n   ECMAScript：`https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/indexed-collections.html#sec-array.prototype.flatmap`  \n   [[1]](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Array/flatMap)\n\n6. **相关：Array.prototype.flat()（英文）**  \n   https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Array/flat  \n   按指定深度递归拼接子数组，默认深度为 1。  \n   [[2]](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Array/flat)\n\n7. **相关：Array.prototype.map()（英文）**  \n   https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Array/map  \n   对每个元素调用函数并组成新数组；文中提到可用 `flatMap` 并返回空数组来删除元素。  \n   [[3]](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Array/map)\n\n8. **相关：Iterator.prototype.flatMap()（英文）**  \n   https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Iterator/flatMap  \n   迭代器版本；与 `Array.prototype.flatMap()` 不同，回调不能返回非迭代器/可迭代的单个值。  \n   [[4]](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Iterator/flatMap)",
